/P 269 0 R
/E (While challenges still abound, I can assure you that the road ahead is filled with opportunities for growth of our industry. We are now closer to achieving our goals than we have ever been before and with your unwavering support, the renewed unity with our partners ZAM, we will strive to push boundaries and reach greater heights. Our collective efforts will drive us towards a more sustainable future.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
