424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 270 0 R
/E (The licensing department has continued to operate under a lot of challenges, especially with the ailing economy which has pushed compliance to its lowest.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 270 0 R
/E (To many of our licensees, load shedding has disturbed their operational capacity, forcing them to reduce their working hours. As such we have had to experience delays and, in most cases, complete refraining to pay for the copyright licence, citing poor overall business performance.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 270 0 R
/E (The department has further been confined to the CBD in its licensing activities and coverage owing to lack of adequate transportation. This challenge has limited the scope and efficiency of our licensing activities across the country.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
