469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 271 0 R
/E (While we had felt we had done enough to get the review of the Copyright and Performance Rights Act No. 44 of 1994 and Amendment No. 25 of 2010 under way, we seriously lament the slow pace in amending the Act or formulating a statutory instrument. We are not slowing down in our push.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
