/P 275 0 R
/E (The board chairperson expressed her heartfelt gratitude, acknowledging the 30-year existence of ZAMCOPS. She took a moment to reflect on both the successes and challenges faced during this time, highlighting the importance of copyright enforcement in enabling music creators to earn royalties for the use of their works. Furthermore, she emphasized the significance of preserving cultural heritage and fostering creativity, which contribute to the growth of the music industry and, by extension, the overall economy.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 275 0 R
/E (The chairperson also extended her thanks to the general membership for their tremendous and unwavering support, which has empowered the board and secretariat to fulfill their mandate in shaping the future of copyright. She greatly appreciated the continuous sharing of information and ideas from the membership.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
551 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 275 0 R
