/E (The K500 was being paid out starting with the earliest registered members and moving up to the newly registered. With over 7,000 registered members, it was not possible to pay everyone in one distribution year, hence the decision to spread the payments. Some members had not submitted updated KYC \(Know Your Client\) documentation as requested; without it, the secretariat had no means of contacting beneficiaries about royalties accrued.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
