1257 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (Zambian artist Pompi has built a loyal following at home and across the region with music that speaks to the heart. Like every creator, he knows that a song is more than sound: it is identity, it is culture and, above all, it is legacy.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (As Zambian music reaches more listeners than ever, artists like Pompi show why knowing your rights matters just as much as making great music.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
