/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (One of the most important tools every artist should understand is the IPI \(Interested Party Information\) number.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (It might sound technical, but it is powerful and essential.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (Think of it as your musical passport. An IPI number identifies you as the rightful creator of your music, so that every song you write stays tied to your name, wherever in the world it is played.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1263 0 obj
