1265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (Zambian music is on the rise, streaming on Spotify, Apple Music, YouTube and many other platforms. As artists like Pompi carry the Zambian sound across borders, professionalism and clarity matter more than ever.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1266 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (An IPI number prevents confusion between artists with similar names. It keeps your music and your legacy distinct, and ensures you are correctly credited in international rights databases.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 295 0 R
/E (In collaborations, whether with fellow Zambian artists or international names, the IPI system makes ownership clear, builds trust and opens doors to opportunities such as sync licensing in film and brand partnerships.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
